  - pde-solver
abstract: >-
  KAN-MLX-Physics is a high-performance implementation of
  Kolmogorov-Arnold Networks optimized for Apple Silicon.
  It provides specialized tools for physics-informed neural
  networks (PINNs), PDE solving, and symbolic regression,
  with features like the batch-grad sum trick for efficient
  derivatives and a physics-first DSL for quantum mechanics
  and cosmology problems.
